title: "sleep-deprivation-scrna: reproducibility bundle for a data commentary on pseudoreplication, data leakage and inference limits in single-cell transcriptomics of sleep deprivation"
abstract: >-
  Companion code and data for a data commentary on mouse single-cell and
  single-nucleus transcriptomic datasets of acute sleep deprivation and
  recovery sleep. The bundle provides a GEO-driven inventory builder that
  regenerates the manuscript's Table 1 directly from NCBI GEO esummary
  records, a PubMed-based audit that verifies every cited reference, the
  randomised-block and magnitude-arithmetic computations, the per-GSM
  adjudication records, and the figure-generation scripts.
